/P 642 0 R
/E (Reduce institutional porosity in transit zones: strengthen the operational capacities of border crossings, establish independent internal oversight mechanisms, train officials in international protection standards, and promote targeted economic alternatives to reduce local dependence on income linked to migration facilitation.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
